{"insertText":{"location":{"index":173900,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table J1. Per-Seed ROC-AUC for Every Model, Regimen, and Test Condition\nNote. Video-level ROC-AUC of each training seed (260901, 260902, 260903) and of the three-seed mean-logit ensemble. X → X = within-dataset. C23/C40 = FaceForensics++ DeepFakes at compression C23/C40; CDF = Celeb-DF v2; DFo = DeeperForensics-1.0. SD from three seeds is descriptive and imprecise. Seeds are not resampled or tested. Per-seed accuracy, precision, recall, specificity, and F1-score were also computed for every cell but are not tabulated; Chapter 4 reports the three-seed ensembles."}},
